  "title": "Unification of Germany",
  "summary": "On 18 January 1871, with France defeated, the German Empire was proclaimed in the Hall of Mirrors at Versailles, and Prussia's King Wilhelm I became German Emperor. Chancellor Otto von Bismarck had first formed the North German Confederation, uniting all the states except those in the south, which then joined it during the war. The new empire was a major power in the centre of Europe, between France and Russia.",
